ST BEGIN case=blobclose arm=memsys5 sqlite=3.22.0
repro allocator=memsys5 heap_bytes=262144
ST READY
blobclose blob_open rc=0
blobclose lookaside status_rc=0 slots_in_use=0 high_water=0  (lookaside OFF: every allocation came straight from memsys5)
blobclose close_v2 rc=0 (zombie path taken; plain close would give 5)
blobclose blob_close rc=0 (the freed-db read already happened)
blobclose NOTRAP done
ST DONE
